          <li><p>
            Swapping two rows of <m>A</m> just reorders the vectors <m>v_1,v_2,\ldots,v_n</m>, hence has no effect on the parallelepiped determined by those vectors.  Thus, <m>\vol(A)</m> is unchanged by row swaps.
            </p>
