    </statement>
    <solution>
      <p>
        Doubling a triangle makes a paralellogram.  We choose two of its sides to be the rows of a matrix.
        </p>
<image width="60%">
<shortdescription>
<!-- FILL: Brief alt-text for this TikZ figure (linear algebra context) -->
</shortdescription>
<description>
<p>
<!-- FILL: Complete accessibility description of this TikZ figure for a linear algebra course -->
